---
description: Composer/Agent TDD session
globs: *Tests.swift
---

1. Check if there any new or failing tests
2. Ask me which test we're going to work with
3. Make an implementation for the given test with a minimal possible solution to pass the test, and run the test
  a. If the test passed go to step 4
  b. If the test failed go to step 3 once, otherwise request a help
4. Wait for me to refoactor changes. I'll let you know when it's done, and than go to step 1


